=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
# play firewall/pve9 -------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Play mode, mocks: the Firewall screen proposed for slice 4,$
# drawn from what real code reads of a simulated host$
# (firewall.Incoming.Check, ufw.Read, pve.ReadFirewall,$
# sshd.ReadEffective, reload.ReadBound), Enable the real$
# steps.PlanUFWEnable on the real plan/apply engine. Install,$
# Disable, the runlevel and the profiles' plans are the$
# gallery's stand-ins, unit (b)'s to build. Nothing on this$
# machine changes: every command and file is the fake's, and its$
# record is shown when play ends.$
$
# Info: firewall/pve9$
# web-01.example.net is a Proxmox VE 9 node, no ufw. pve-$
# firewall running and disabled, as installed.$
$
# Firewall Configuration #######################################$
$
  [ ] Firewall             Not Configured disabled$
$
# pve-firewall -------------------------------------------------$
$
  [+] Service              Running$
  [ ] Enabled              No$
   -  Incoming policy      Drop$
   -  SSH (22)             Not filtered$
   -  Web UI (8006)        Not filtered$
   -  hardn reads pve-firewall and doesn't change it: a wrong$
      rule can cut off the web UI and the cluster.$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter selection [0 or q]: 0$
$
# simulated system ---------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Nothing was applied.$
$

